713
00:50:27,160 --> 00:50:31,120
The first is progressive
multifocal leukoencephalopathy.

714
00:50:31,120 --> 00:50:33,800
We have mentioned this
before. This is caused

715
00:50:33,800 --> 00:50:40,820
