infection is widespread and

716
00:50:40,820 --> 00:50:46,020
90% of humans are infected
with no symptoms. But

717
00:50:46,020 --> 00:50:49,960
in those who are immune
suppressed, it causes a

718
00:50:49,960 --> 00:50:55,060
