is antiretroviral therapy.

727
00:51:29,220 --> 00:51:32,280
There is no specific treatment
for the virus itself,

728
00:51:32,390 --> 00:51:37,360
and the response to treatment
is variable with some

729
00:51:37,360 --> 00:51:40,700
