tissue cysts in raw or

733
00:51:53,200 --> 00:51:57,080
undercooked meat. In the
immune-competent person, it

734
00:51:57,080 --> 00:52:01,640
can be asymptomatic but may
present as seizures from

735
00:52:01,640 --> 00:52:05,520
calcified cerebral cysts.
If transmission occurs

736
00:52:05,520 --> 00:52:10,020
